# 🍿 Smart Brain Snacks | سناكات العقل الذكية ☁️✨

An interactive cloud-based web application built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It helps content creators, developers, and AI enthusiasts instantly access and copy the most powerful and viral AI prompts (ChatGPT personas, social media hooks, copywriting frameworks, debugging scripts, and more) with a single click!

---

## 🚀 Key Features
- **"Blu" the Cloud Companion ☁️:** An interactive, funny mascot built right into the app that delivers witty jokes, motivational boosts, and cloud humor on demand!
- **Dual Language Support (Arabic & English 🌐):** Fully switchable interface and content with a single click.
- **Dark & Light Mode (🌙☀️):** Modern, eye-friendly themes tailored for day and night use.
- **Instant Search 🔍:** Quickly filter and find the exact prompt or snack you need.
- **Sleek UI & Animations ✨:** Designed with dreamy sky-blue gradients, glowing cards, and smooth micro-interactions.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **HTML5** (Structure)
- **CSS3** (Styling, Gradients, Animations, & Dark Mode)
- **JavaScript (Vanilla)** (Interactivity, Language Localization, and Blu's Dynamic Engine)

